data: {"id":"chatcmpl-f5fb3da1-98c4-46ca-ab71-ae6b38ad3480","object":"chat.completion.chunk","created":1779190995,"model":"x","usage":null,"choices":[{"index":0,"delta":{"content":"**Verdict:** yes  \n**Type:** PROG  \n**SM69 command:** `ZFTP_BNPP` (from `p_comm` default)  \n**Direction:** push (it builds a local→remote style parameter string: `user:pass@domain[:port] <source> <file_ext> <host_key> <destination>`, then executes an SM69 command)  \n**Auth pattern:** password-based (reads `FTP_PSWD`; no `PRIVATE_KEY_PATH` usage found)\n\n**Evidence (location:line — snippet):**\n- **SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE call** (ZSFTP_BNP_PARIBAS ~line 140):\n  ```abap\n  CALL FUNCTION 'SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE'\n    EXPORTING\n      commandname           = p_comm\n      additional_parameters = g_path\n  ```\n- **PARAMETERS p_comm DEFAULT** (ZSFTP_BNP_PARIBAS ~line 20):\n  ```abap\n  PARAMETERS: p_comm TYPE  sxpgcolist-name OBLIGATORY DEFAULT 'ZFTP_BNPP' .\n  ```\n- **Credential reads from zfi_constants (fnam keys)** (ZSFTP_BNP_PARIBAS ~lines 30–75):\n  ```abap\n  READ TABLE i_constants INTO wa_constants WITH KEY fnam = 'FTP_USER'.\n  ...\n  READ TABLE i_constants INTO wa_constants WITH KEY fnam = 'FTP_PSWD'.\n  ...\n  READ TABLE i_constants INTO wa_constants WITH KEY fnam = 'FTP_DOMAIN'.\n  READ TABLE i_constants INTO wa_constants WITH KEY fnam = 'FTP_PORT'.\n  ```\n  (Also used for routing/payload params: `SOURCE_FOLDER`, `FILE_EXT`, `HOST_KEY`, `DESTINATION_FOLDER`.)\n\n**Notes:** business artifact: “SFTP BNP PARIBAS” report that shells out via SM69 (`SXPG_COMMAND_EXECUTE`) to perform an SFTP transfer; payload role appears to be **sending** files from an SAP-appserver source folder to a BNP Paribas destination folder, with host key verification (`HOST_KEY`) and **password** authentication (`FTP_PSWD`)."},"finish_reason":null}]}

